    level: 'orta', cefr: 'B2', konu: ['akış'],
    q: 'Each of the two Voyager probes carries an unusual piece of cargo: a gold-coated disc known as the Golden Record. It holds a selection of sounds, music and images meant to give an impression of life on the Earth. ----. Even so, the chance that anyone will ever find one of the records is extremely small, and many people see them mainly as a message to ourselves.',
